          <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="body-md">Equipment concerns can affect both immediate operating needs and longer-term fleet decisions. Start with the asset involved, the issue you are seeing and the outcome your organization needs. Discuss equipment evaluation and repair requirements with TRG. Share available service records and operating information so the scope, suitability and availability of support can be confirmed.</p>
