          <h3 class="heading-md">Equipment Evaluation</h3>
          <p class="body-md">Evaluation begins with understanding the vehicle or equipment asset and the decision it needs to support. Discuss its use, available condition information and the concerns your team has identified.</p>
          <h4 class="heading-sm">Useful Context</h4>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Equipment type and current role</li>
            <li>Known issues and available records</li>
